  "label": "Absurd Juxtaposition",
  "description": "This is a comedic technique where two unrelated or incongruous elements are placed together to create humor through surprise or illogical contrast. In this meme, the mundane function of a washing machine is juxtaposed with the sophisticated skill of making martinis and the criminal act of stealing tambourines, creating a punchline based on the absurdity of the comparison.",
